    <mxCell id="942" value="&lt;b&gt;📌 transaction_type (거래 유형)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DEPOSIT: 입금 | WITHDRAW: 출금 | TRANSFER: 이체&lt;br&gt;INTEREST: 이자 지급 | SAVINGS_PAYMENT: 적금 납입&lt;br&gt;PAYMENT: 결제 | REVERSAL: 취소/정정&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;contract_id nullable 규칙&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;INTEREST·SAVINGS_PAYMENT → NOT NULL (계약 기반)&lt;br&gt;그 외 (DEPOSIT·WITHDRAW·TRANSFER·PAYMENT·REVERSAL) → NULL&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;direction_type (거래 방향)&lt;/b&gt;: IN 입금성 | OUT 출금성&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;status (거래 상태)&lt;/b&gt;: SUCCESS | FAILED | CANCELED | PENDING&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;channel_type (거래 채널)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BRANCH: 창구 | ATM | INTERNET | MOBILE | SYSTEM&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;[이체 전용] transfer_type (이체 유형)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;INTERNAL: 내부이체 | EXTERNAL: 타행이체&lt;br&gt;AUTO: 자동이체 | SCHEDULED: 예약이체&lt;br&gt;counterparty_customer_id: VARCHAR(30), FK 없음 (외부 시스템)&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;[결제 전용] payment_method (결제 방법)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CARD | ACCOUNT_TRANSFER | EASY_PAY&lt;br&gt;merchant_id: 카드사·PG사가 부여한 가맹점 고유번호&lt;br&gt;merchant_name: 카드사·PG사로부터 수신한 가맹점명&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(영수증에 표시되는 상호명. PAYMENT 거래에만 유효, 그 외 NULL)&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;[취소 전용] original_transaction_id (원 거래ID)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;REVERSAL 거래가 참조하는 원 거래 ID (자기 참조 FK)&lt;br&gt;──────────────────────&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;[실패] failure_type (실패 유형)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TRANSFER / CARD_PAYMENT / AUTH / LIMIT / SYSTEM&lt;br&gt;failure_reason_code (실패 원인 코드): INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE / LIMIT_EXCEEDED&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;INVALID_ACCOUNT / CARD_DECLINED / AUTH_FAILED / SYSTEM_ERROR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="2560" y="1442" width="560" height="620" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
